{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/91cefa6e5ea81705cc7192691ebe852b.poster.avif?t=1767807727\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/91cefa6e5ea81705cc7192691ebe852b.webm?t=1767807727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/91cefa6e5ea81705cc7192691ebe852b.mp4?t=1767807727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person voxel mining game with idle-style progression. Play as a lone dwarven miner smashing through rock, collecting ores, and upgrading your tools to dig deeper and mine faster. The further you go, the more powerful\u2014and explosive\u2014it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Unique Pickaxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/81a2554e1d005310f9888a3348ebef6b.poster.avif?t=1767807727\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/81a2554e1d005310f9888a3348ebef6b.webm?t=1767807727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/81a2554e1d005310f9888a3348ebef6b.mp4?t=1767807727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and unlock a variety of pickaxes, each with its own special twist. Whether it's a pickaxe that <strong>blows up surrounding ores</strong>, <strong>zaps blocks with lightning</strong>, or <strong>pulls resources toward you</strong>, every new tool opens up a new way to mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/c524ef402d0f9fcdca7b3291561c266f.poster.avif?t=1767807727\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/c524ef402d0f9fcdca7b3291561c266f.webm?t=1767807727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/c524ef402d0f9fcdca7b3291561c266f.mp4?t=1767807727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn ore into power and boost your mining efficiency:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine faster</strong> with increased swing speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit bigger</strong> with expanded mining radius and range</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go longer</strong> with more stamina and faster regen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start slow, end unstoppable.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852400?t=1767807727","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852400?t=1767807727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/7eeca88d2f8e08d35be71c3222d9549530e6836d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767807727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/7eeca88d2f8e08d35be71c3222d9549530e6836d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767807727","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"fu