e.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/c524ef402d0f9fcdca7b3291561c266f.poster.avif?t=1767807727\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/c524ef402d0f9fcdca7b3291561c266f.webm?t=1767807727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/extras/c524ef402d0f9fcdca7b3291561c266f.mp4?t=1767807727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn ore into power and boost your mining efficiency:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine faster</strong> with increased swing speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit bigger</strong> with expanded mining radius and range</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go longer</strong> with more stamina and faster regen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start slow, end unstoppable.</p>","developers":["IamChris"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852400/1304641387cfb1729c2084241f24c96ec341e9f6/header.jpg?t=1767807727","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852400/1194941038/87a45c70f1f44c3f21b8ea01afe4d481bafd83f1/1753619957/dash_av